 .\nYou are inside the path\, 20 km from its centre line: the star vanishes
  for up to 7.4 s.\nClosest approach 20:33:36 IST\, give or take 1 s. The s
 tar is 31° up in the SE · dark sky.\nIt fades 2.3 magnitudes for up to 8
 .1 s on the centre line\, and the path is 88 km wide\, give or take 14 km.
 \nFinder chart\, the map and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/ast
 eroids-2027-07#2027-07-25-240-vanadis-335936
